# Restriction Enzyme: EcoRI

@left

- `G|AATTC`
- Draw the double strand?

@right

![Coupled source region](assets/lect02e-restriction_enzymes/source_region_49c247fe3440e21fb61dfbc7e70c94d3fc1bec6435f296a7a116a123879ea685.png)

=== layout: two-panels

# Restriction Enzyme: EcoRI

@left

- `G|AATTC`
- Draw the double strand?
  - 5&prime;-`G|AATTC`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA|G`-5&prime;
- Is it a blunt or sticky end?

@right

![Coupled source region](assets/lect02e-restriction_enzymes/source_region_49c247fe3440e21fb61dfbc7e70c94d3fc1bec6435f296a7a116a123879ea685.png)

=== layout: two-panels

# Restriction Enzyme: EcoRI

@left

- `G|AATTC`
- Draw the double strand?
  - 5&prime;-`G|AATTC`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA|G`-5&prime;
- Is it a blunt or sticky end?
  - 5&prime;-G
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA`-5&prime;
- What is the overhang?

@right

![Coupled source region](assets/lect02e-restriction_enzymes/source_region_49c247fe3440e21fb61dfbc7e70c94d3fc1bec6435f296a7a116a123879ea685.png)

=== layout: two-panels

# Restriction Enzyme: EcoRI

@left

- `G|AATTC`
- Draw the double strand?
  - 5&prime;-`G|AATTC`-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA|G`-5&prime;
- Is it a blunt or sticky end?
  - 5&prime;-G-3&prime;
  - 3&prime;-`CTTAA`-5&prime;
- What is the overhang?
  - 5&prime; overhang (the 5&prime; is all alone at the end)
  - 3&prime;-`TTAA`-5&prime; or 5&prime;-`AATT`-3&prime;

@right

![Coupled source region](assets/lect02e-restriction_enzymes/source_region_49c247fe3440e21fb61dfbc7e70c94d3fc1bec6435f296a7a116a123879ea685.png)

=== layout: two-panels

